WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.042
Walking through the woods, Alice noticed a tree with a door in its trunk.

2
00:00:06.062 --> 00:00:07.403
"That's strange!"

3
00:00:07.423 --> 00:00:08.004
she said.

4
00:00:08.024 --> 00:00:09.825
"But everything's strange today.

5
00:00:09.845 --> 00:00:15.829
I might as well go through the door."

6
00:00:36.116 --> 00:00:39.379
Alice soon found herself in the hall with the glass table.

7
00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:42.602
"Oh, I'm back here again!

8
00:00:43.663 --> 00:00:46.265
Let's see if I can do things in the right order this time."

9
00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:56.373
First, Alice used the gold key to unlock the garden door.

10
00:00:57.234 --> 00:01:00.097
Then, she took a piece of mushroom from her pocket.

11
00:01:01.318 --> 00:01:03.700
She nibbled it until she was a foot high.

12
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:09.603
Finally, she walked through the door and into the beautiful garden.

13
00:01:14.848 --> 00:01:17.390
A large rosebush stood near the entrance.

14
00:01:18.251 --> 00:01:22.715
Its flowers were white, but three gardeners were busy painting them red.

15
00:01:23.776 --> 00:01:26.979
The gardeners wore outfits that looked like playing cards.

16
00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:32.704
Alice noticed that they were the two, five, and seven of spades.

17
00:01:35.184 --> 00:01:36.685
"Be careful, Five!"

18
00:01:37.085 --> 00:01:37.685
Two said.

19
00:01:37.705 --> 00:01:40.786
"You're splashing paint on me."

20
00:01:40.806 --> 00:01:44.008
"I couldn't help it," Five said.

21
00:01:44.028 --> 00:01:46.569
"Seven bumped my elbow."

22
00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:49.690
Seven scowled.

23
00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:52.891
"You're always blaming everyone else, Five!

24
00:01:53.232 --> 00:01:59.894
You should—" Spotting Alice, Seven bowed low, as did the other cards.

25
00:02:01.335 --> 00:02:03.436
Alice suddenly felt a bit shy.

26
00:02:04.204 --> 00:02:07.005
"Would you please tell me why you're painting those roses?"

27
00:02:08.326 --> 00:02:09.206
Two spoke up.

28
00:02:09.726 --> 00:02:14.308
"Well, you see, miss, the Queen wanted a red rosebush.

29
00:02:15.349 --> 00:02:23.472
We planted a white one by mistake, and if she found out—" "She'd cut off our heads!"

30
00:02:23.972 --> 00:02:24.633
Seven said.

31
00:02:25.753 --> 00:02:28.334
Five was looking anxiously around the garden.

32
00:02:28.354 --> 00:02:30.855
"The Queen!

33
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:31.916
The Queen!"

34
00:02:32.216 --> 00:02:32.776
he shouted.

35
00:02:33.872 --> 00:02:38.075
All three cards instantly threw themselves on the ground, facedown.

36
00:02:39.477 --> 00:02:41.498
Alice looked up to see a parade.

37
00:02:42.399 --> 00:02:44.140
First came ten soldiers.

38
00:02:45.161 --> 00:02:50.765
Their outfits were shaped like playing cards too, but they had clubs instead of spades.

39
00:02:51.926 --> 00:02:55.989
Next came ten royal children, whose outfits had hearts.

40
00:02:57.451 --> 00:02:58.772
After that came some others.

41
00:03:03.628 --> 00:03:04.649
"There's the White Rabbit!"

42
00:03:04.949 --> 00:03:05.469
Alice said.

43
00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.272
He seemed quite nervous and didn't notice her as he passed.

44
00:03:13.513 --> 00:03:19.337
Then came the Knave of Hearts, followed by his parents, the King and Queen of Hearts.

45
00:03:19.937 --> 00:03:22.779
When the King and Queen reached Alice, they stopped.

46
00:03:24.139 --> 00:03:27.321
Everyone else stopped too, turning to stare at her.

47
00:03:27.341 --> 00:03:30.903
"Who are you?"

48
00:03:31.543 --> 00:03:32.464
the Queen demanded.

49
00:03:34.236 --> 00:03:37.857
"My name is Alice," she said aloud in a polite voice.

50
00:03:38.877 --> 00:03:42.278
But to herself she said, "They're only a pack of cards!

51
00:03:42.978 --> 00:03:44.539
There's no need to be afraid of them."

52
00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:48.820
The Queen noticed the three gardeners.

53
00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:53.261
Their backs matched those of her soldiers and her children.

54
00:03:53.281 --> 00:03:56.342
"And who are these people?"

55
00:03:56.362 --> 00:03:58.623
"How should I know?"

56
00:03:58.923 --> 00:04:01.483
Alice said, surprised at her own courage.

57
00:04:02.644 --> 00:04:07.125
Turning bright red, the Queen screamed, "Off with her head!"

58
00:04:08.986 --> 00:04:11.407
"Nonsense!" Alice said loudly.

59
00:04:12.488 --> 00:04:15.950
The Queen went silent, but she still looked angry.

60
00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:19.051
The King put his hand on the Queen's arm.

61
00:04:19.831 --> 00:04:23.073
"She's only a child," he said.

62
00:04:23.093 --> 00:04:26.855
"Get up!"

63
00:04:27.355 --> 00:04:30.420
the Queen screamed at the gardeners.

64
00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:34.582
The three gardeners popped up and began bowing to everyone at once.

65
00:04:36.203 --> 00:04:37.083
"Stop that!

66
00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:39.304
You're making me dizzy!"

67
00:04:39.804 --> 00:04:40.725
the Queen shouted.

68
00:04:44.346 --> 00:04:45.767
She pointed to the rosebush.

69
00:04:46.627 --> 00:04:48.248
"What's going on here?"

70
00:04:48.268 --> 00:04:52.570
"We're trying Two began.

71
00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:54.531
"I can see that!

72
00:04:55.031 --> 00:04:56.091
Off with their heads!"

73
00:04:56.711 --> 00:05:01.933
the Queen shouted, and the parade began to move again.

74
00:05:05.175 --> 00:05:08.938
Terrified, the gardeners ran to Alice for protection.

75
00:05:08.958 --> 00:05:12.740
"I won't let the soldiers hurt you," she said.

76
00:05:14.181 --> 00:05:19.244
Alice quickly hid them in a flowerpot while the soldiers searched high and low.

77
00:05:19.264 --> 00:05:23.706
"Are their heads off?"

78
00:05:24.247 --> 00:05:26.168
the Queen shouted back at the soldiers.

79
00:05:27.956 --> 00:05:31.159
"Of course, Your Majesty," the soldiers replied.

80
00:05:33.161 --> 00:05:36.343
Giving up their search, they joined the end of the parade.

81
00:05:37.584 --> 00:05:40.307
The Queen shouted over her shoulder to Alice.

82
00:05:40.327 --> 00:05:43.349
"Can you play croquet?"

83
00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:48.013
Alice was surprised, but she replied, "Yes."

84
00:05:48.033 --> 00:05:53.358
"Then come with us," the Queen called, and Alice joined the parade.
